From: Wentao Liang <vulab@iscas.ac.cn>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 12:04:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: ath12k: release rproc resources after IRQ setup failure

Backport the rproc IRQ error unwind to the current AHB loader. Release
the registered notifier and rproc reference if IRQ configuration fails,
using the existing cleanup labels. The successful initialization path
and the firmware loading/recovery contract are unchanged.

Signed-off-by: Wentao Liang <vulab@iscas.ac.cn>
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/all/20260917120443.2150370-1-vulab@iscas.ac.cn/
---
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/ahb.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/ahb.c
@@ -1101,7 +1101,11 @@
 		}
 	}
 
-	return ath12k_ahb_config_rproc_irq(ab);
+	ret = ath12k_ahb_config_rproc_irq(ab);
+	if (ret < 0)
+		goto err_unreg_notifier;
+
+	return 0;
 
 err_unreg_notifier:
 	ath12k_ahb_unregister_rproc_notifier(ab);
